<title>FRANCE: Total first half net attrib rises 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Total first half net attrib rises 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   2,630  vs	   1,809</p>
<p>    Net attrib excluding exceptionals    2,630  vs	   1,965</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)     11  vs	    7.80</p>
<p>    Operating				    4,958  vs	   3,472</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     7,007  vs	   5,624</p>
<p>    Turnover				    80,664  vs	  67,209</p>
<p>    Debt/equity ratio			 18 pct, unchanged</p>
<p>NOTE - French oil company Total SA gave the results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said investments rose 33 percent to 6.84 billion francs. Disinvestments in the first half of 1996 were 1.49 billion francs, compared with 1.76 billion in the prior-year period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
